      website belong exclusively to Marius Bleif or to the specifically named
      rights holders. The written consent of the copyright holder must be obtained
      in advance for the reproduction of any element.
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      How personal data is handled is described in the
      <a href="/privacy-policy">privacy policy</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
